BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Busy Mom Webinar: Social Security Basics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T235900
UID:4274bc7716091abf071b98f98fb0a3b1@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Mary Jo Kerrigan\, Financial Advisor at Equitable Advisor
 s\, on the second Wednesday of each month for a brief\, informative webina
 r designed to help you make smarter financial decisions with confidence. D
 esigned with busy moms who don't have time to waste in mind\, each session
  delivers practical insights you can put to work right away - all in just 
 20 minutes. Social Security is an important source of retirement income. B
 ut knowing when and how to claim your benefits can have a lasting impact o
 n your financial future. During this session\, we'll cover the basics of S
 ocial Security\, including: How your benefits are calculated When you can 
 begin claiming benefits How claiming age affects your monthly benefit Key 
 factors to consider before making your decision Common mistakes to avoid W
 hether retirement is just around the corner or still a few years away\, th
 is session will provide the foundational knowledge you need to make more i
 nformed decisions about your retirement income. Register 
URL:https://business.northessexchamber.com/events/details/the-busy-mom-web
 inar-social-security-basics
X-SOURCE:North Essex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
